WEBVTT

00:01:28.738 --> 00:01:30.756
Lekin bu ko'p muammo tug'dirgan.

00:01:30.756 --> 00:01:32.473
Shulardan bittasi

00:01:32.473 --> 00:01:35.106
arab tilida yevropaliklar uchun 
o'rganmasdan turib

00:01:35.106 --> 00:01:38.105
talaffuz qilishda qiyinchilik 
tug'diradigan

00:01:38.105 --> 00:01:40.372
tovushlarning mavjudligi edi.

00:01:40.372 --> 00:01:42.106
Ishoning.

00:01:42.106 --> 00:01:44.323
Bundan tashqari, nu tovushlar

00:01:44.323 --> 00:01:46.237
yevropa tillarida mavjud bo'lmagan

00:01:46.237 --> 00:01:49.825
turli belgilarda berilgan edi.

00:01:49.825 --> 00:01:51.639
"Aybdor"lardan biri —

00:01:51.639 --> 00:01:53.523
'sheen' harfi,

00:01:53.523 --> 00:01:57.122
biz uchun 'sh' bo'lib eshitiladigan.

00:01:57.122 --> 00:01:59.724
U shuningdek 'shayun' so'zidagi

00:01:59.724 --> 00:02:02.156
birinchi harfdir.